# ============================================================
#  .gitignore — keep the repo lean (code + docs + deploy pkgs).
#  Excludes multi-GB venvs, datasets, and >100MB checkpoints
#  that GitHub can't/shouldn't host.
# ============================================================

# --- virtual environments (the compat_env venv is ~9.5 GB) ---
**/venv/
size_reduction/compat_env/venv/

# --- datasets (thousands of images) ---
data/
dataset for test/
new dataset for test/
retraining_data/
datasets/
ROI/
26788 images for test/
23 june analysis/
retraining dataset with label/
finetune/dataset_retrain/

# --- training outputs & checkpoints (200 MB+ files, > GitHub limit) ---
size_reduction/compat_env/output/
size_reduction/prune_qat/qat_output/
size_reduction/prune_qat/prune_output/
size_reduction/prune_qat/prune_inference/
size_reduction/legacy_server/
finetune/output/
finetune/output_retrain/
finetune/pretrained/

# --- source model binaries (large; the DEPLOYABLE models live in
#     deploy/ and ARE committed) ---
finetune/inference/
finetune/inference_v2/
finetune/inference_v3/
finetune/inference_backup_2026-07-13/
finetune/inference_v2_backup_2026-07-13/
finetune/dataset/
size_reduction/models/
size_reduction/prune_qat/qat_inference/

# --- regenerable outputs / junk ---
results/*.html
analysis/**/dashboard.html
analysis/**/*.jpg
analysis/**/*.jpeg
analysis/**/*.png
*.bak
sym_shape_infer_temp.onnx
*.onnx.data

# --- backups & logs ---
deploy/*_OLD_backup_*/
*.log

# --- python / os cruft ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# NOTE: the deploy/ptq_int8/ and deploy/qat_int8/ folders (with their
# ~21-22 MB model files) ARE committed on purpose — they are the
# ready-to-ship deliverables. deploy/ptq_py38/ is untracked (local variant).

# --- redundant / local ---
*.zip
.claude/
MODELS/meterocr_*
